(7427573, 1173138, 156466, '<td valign="top">This photo loses so much impact when it displays in the reduced size necessary to put 1000px of vertical image in a horizontal window. When first loaded the image displays full size and the details of the stained glass are visible - really extraordinary.  Then it compresses and BAM, all that impact is gone.  I say that not to knock your choice of orientation but to, perhaps, explain why this may not do as well as you had hoped.  Let''s hope that''s not the case.  7 (though I may be back to bump this at the end)</td>', 'This photo loses so much impact when it displays in the reduced size necessary to put 1000px of vertical image in a horizontal window. When first loaded the image displays full size and the details of the stained glass are visible - really extraordinary.  Then it compresses and BAM, all that impact is gone.  I say that not to knock your choice of orientation but to, perhaps, explain why this may not do as well as you had hoped.  Let''s hope that''s not the case.  7 (though I may be back to bump this at the end)', '2016-01-12 11:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
