(7427873, 1173098, 156466, '<td valign="top">I replied to your post but thought I''d give you a specific comment about the image and the votes I see.  It''s technically very good, but it''s also what I would refer to as "familiar".  When I look at your vote distribution you have five 9''s and a pair of 10''s to go with the 1 and 3''s.  You''ll notice that this place tends to grade on a fairly evenly distributed curve until you hit the very top and the very bottom, so what you see here isn''t unusual.  I was back and forth between a 5 &amp; 6 on this one and went with the 5 because of the familiarity of it (it''s one of the things I expected to see in "Circles", as were the pencils and oil/water shots).  Take heart in the 9''s and 10''s, they don''t come easy in this place.</td>', 'I replied to your post but thought I''d give you a specific comment about the image and the votes I see.  It''s technically very good, but it''s also what I would refer to as "familiar".  When I look at your vote distribution you have five 9''s and a pair of 10''s to go with the 1 and 3''s.  You''ll notice that this place tends to grade on a fairly evenly distributed curve until you hit the very top and the very bottom, so what you see here isn''t unusual.  I was back and forth between a 5 & 6 on this one and went with the 5 because of the familiarity of it (it''s one of the things I expected to see in "Circles", as were the pencils and oil/water shots).  Take heart in the 9''s and 10''s, they don''t come easy in this place.', '2016-01-13 09:40:06.000000', NULL, 0),
