(7427930, 1173098, 14476, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, Gipper.  And yes, the range of photographers and their preferences on this site is vast.<br/>ones, twos and threes just go with the territory. Some voters just use the  bottom half of the scale;<br/>others use the top half.  As SC says, the vote scrubber takes away the votes that try to game the system.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, Gipper.  And yes, the range of photographers and their preferences on this site is vast.ones, twos and threes just go with the territory. Some voters just use the  bottom half of the scale;others use the top half.  As SC says, the vote scrubber takes away the votes that try to game the system.', '2016-01-13 12:55:52.000000', NULL, 0),
