(7429077, 1173098, 47974, '<td valign="top">I did not vote in this challenge but would have given your image a 3.  This is based on several things.  First, all photographs I vote on start at a 5 if they meet the theme and go up/down from there based on several things.  For your photo I would have deducted 1 because I personally detest shots like this, in the studio will a solid white background and nothing but the subject.......to me they are just boring unless extremely well done and this is not.  You would have lost another point because you did not get one shade of white for the background, it kind of goes from gray to white which I find more distracting then if it was one even color all the way thru.</td>', 'I did not vote in this challenge but would have given your image a 3.  This is based on several things.  First, all photographs I vote on start at a 5 if they meet the theme and go up/down from there based on several things.  For your photo I would have deducted 1 because I personally detest shots like this, in the studio will a solid white background and nothing but the subject.......to me they are just boring unless extremely well done and this is not.  You would have lost another point because you did not get one shade of white for the background, it kind of goes from gray to white which I find more distracting then if it was one even color all the way thru.', '2016-01-17 11:39:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7429842, 1172974, 69008, '<td valign="top">Magical. <br/>Congrats on your new blue too!</td>', 'Magical. Congrats on your new blue too!', '2016-01-18 22:04:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7429843, 1172963, 69008, '<td valign="top">Very cool looking image, and great application for the shooting technique.  Congrats!</td>', 'Very cool looking image, and great application for the shooting technique.  Congrats!', '2016-01-18 22:05:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7429847, 1173033, 69008, '<td valign="top">It''s a Spiny Orb-Weaver.  <br/>These little spiders are quite common here in South Florida. <br/>They are tough to photograph due to the huge contrast in white &amp; black on them. <br/>Good job.</td>', 'It''s a Spiny Orb-Weaver.  These little spiders are quite common here in South Florida. They are tough to photograph due to the huge contrast in white & black on them. Good job.', '2016-01-18 22:18:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7430737, 1173084, 59029, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>This is just not a good photo at all. The focus is soft, there is a lot of image grain, there is no attempt at all at composition and the colours are very washy.  This sort of image is barely worthy of being called a snapshot.<br/> <br/>Susan</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club This is just not a good photo at all. The focus is soft, there is a lot of image grain, there is no attempt at all at composition and the colours are very washy.  This sort of image is barely worthy of being called a snapshot. Susan', '2016-01-21 18:40:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7430738, 1173035, 59029, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>Definitely an image full of circles, so certainly meets the challenge description.  Very poppy colours and saturation, nice clean leading lines, good focus esp for such a huge tree. A few hotspots here and there but quite understandable as this looks like a shot taken probably around noon or early afternoon on a bright, clear sunny day. <br/> <br/>I think too many voters were put off by the triangular shape of tree and sky and saw the globes of the ornaments as secondary. Still, a vote not far shy off of 6 isn''t anything to sneeze at.  <br/> <br/>Keep up the good work and keep entering!<br/> <br/>Susan</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! Definitely an image full of circles, so certainly meets the challenge description.  Very poppy colours and saturation, nice clean leading lines, good focus esp for such a huge tree. A few hotspots here and there but quite understandable as this looks like a shot taken probably around noon or early afternoon on a bright, clear sunny day.  I think too many voters were put off by the triangular shape of tree and sky and saw the globes of the ornaments as secondary. Still, a vote not far shy off of 6 isn''t anything to sneeze at.   Keep up the good work and keep entering! Susan', '2016-01-21 18:45:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7431103, 1173150, 18505, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully creative, poignant interpretation of this challenge which deserved a much higher score.</td>', 'Wonderfully creative, poignant interpretation of this challenge which deserved a much higher score.', '2016-01-22 11:42:31.000000', NULL, 0);
COMMIT;
